{"unit_id":"969246694__dsh-transparent#card-zh","repo":"969246694/dsh-transparent","commit":"802162024faaf0a3c10b7e42492427f1c29205bc","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-transparent 是面向 DSH 桌面客户端的界面插件，可让 Windows 窗口透出桌面壁纸。宿主端启动时调用 PowerShell helper 设置窗口透明度并持续观察窗口样式；浏览器端清除应用外壳背景，并为输入框加入 SVG 位移贴图驱动的液态玻璃效果。它还可将界面主题设为深色，并检查是否有新版本。适合希望调整 DSH 桌面观感的用户；透明窗口效果需要 Windows。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:194-210","lib/client.js:44-50","lib/client.js:475-490"]}
{"unit_id":"969246694__dsh-transparent#card-en","repo":"969246694/dsh-transparent","commit":"802162024faaf0a3c10b7e42492427f1c29205bc","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-transparent makes a DSH desktop window translucent so wallpaper shows through. On Windows it applies opacity with a PowerShell helper; its browser code clears the shell background and adds an SVG based glass effect to the composer. It can set dark theme and check for updates.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:194-210","lib/client.js:44-50","lib/client.js:475-490"]}
