{"unit_id":"969246694__dsh-transparent#feature-1","repo":"969246694/dsh-transparent","commit":"802162024faaf0a3c10b7e42492427f1c29205bc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-transparent 的「桌面窗口透壁纸」功能：在 Windows 桌面客户端启动时设置窗口透明度，并在启动阶段监视样式变化后重新应用。透明度由 alpha 配置控制。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:194-210","assets/window-glass.ps1:1-15"]}
{"unit_id":"969246694__dsh-transparent#feature-2","repo":"969246694/dsh-transparent","commit":"802162024faaf0a3c10b7e42492427f1c29205bc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-transparent 的「输入框液态玻璃」功能：浏览器端定位 DSH 输入框卡片，生成 SVG 折射贴图并添加 backdrop-filter 玻璃样式。效果取决于输入框后方是否有内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:44-50","lib/client.js:475-490","lib/client.js:797-818"]}
{"unit_id":"969246694__dsh-transparent#feature-3","repo":"969246694/dsh-transparent","commit":"802162024faaf0a3c10b7e42492427f1c29205bc","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-transparent 的「自动深色主题」功能：启用 darkTheme 时读取并更新 DSH 的 ui-theme.preference 设置，将界面设为深色；设为 false 可跳过该操作。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:228-245","lib/index.js:262-296"]}
{"unit_id":"969246694__dsh-transparent#caveat-1","repo":"969246694/dsh-transparent","commit":"802162024faaf0a3c10b7e42492427f1c29205bc","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-transparent 使用前须知：窗口透明效果仅在 Windows 上启用，其他平台会跳过宿主端窗口处理；深色主题设置默认为开启。 （见 lib/index.js:194-203、lib/index.js:382-390）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:194-203","lib/index.js:382-390"]}
{"unit_id":"969246694__dsh-transparent#caveat-2","repo":"969246694/dsh-transparent","commit":"802162024faaf0a3c10b7e42492427f1c29205bc","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-transparent 使用前须知：启用 darkTheme 会写入持久的 ui-theme.preference，卸载插件不会自动恢复此前的主题偏好。 （见 lib/index.js:239-245）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:239-245"]}
